== the localization of ZZ at 2 ==
L                                            => Localization of Integer Ring at Submonoid generated by (2,) in Integer Ring
L(cardinal(7))                               => 7
L(7)                                         => 7
L(ZZ(7))                                     => 7
L(QQ(1)/2)                                   => (1)/(2)
L(SageQQ(1)/2)                               => (1)/(2)
cardinal(7) in L                             => True
ZZ(7) in L                                   => True
QQ(1)/2 in L                                 => True
QQ(3) in L                                   => True
SageQQ(3) in L                               => False
L(3) == L(6)/L(2)                            => True
